{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Trade Rivals - Goblin Age</i> now supports <strong>Single Player Mode</strong>! \ud83c\udf89</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've heard your feedback, and now you can enjoy the full goblin trading chaos, even when playing solo. Challenge AI-driven rivals, master your pricing strategies, and experience the unpredictable economy without needing other players.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play <strong>solo or multiplayer,</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice strategies at your own pace,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience new balance improvements &amp; bug fixes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to sharpen your skills or enjoy a goblin shop rivalry on your own, this update makes <i>Trade Rivals</i> more accessible than ever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <i>Trade Rivals \u2013 Goblin Age</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic 2\u20134 player competitive shop management game where <strong>gutsy pricing, clever shelf setups, and sneaky sabotage</strong> are your weapons in the market war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/d86936bcfcc7a6493dc552b099d5fef1.poster.avif?t=1759448277\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/d86936bcfcc7a6493dc552b099d5fef1.webm?t=1759448277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/d86936bcfcc7a6493dc552b099d5fef1.mp4?t=1759448277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Loop: 10 Days of Goblin Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins with randomized economic scenarios that shift product prices and stock levels. Every day, players have limited time to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase products from the supplier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place shelves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set competitive prices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble at the <i>Wheel of Chance</i> for risky bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for customers in real time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once players flip their signs, sales begin: customers flow in, grab what they want, and check out at your register\u2014fast hands and calm nerves win gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/b9f850403d7c59161c0304d3d1b951cc.poster.avif?t=1759448277\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/b9f850403d7c59161c0304d3d1b951cc.webm?t=1759448277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/b9f850403d7c59161c0304d3d1b951cc.mp4?t=1759448277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sabotage &amp; Fountain of Luck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/07fc2beaa94f3e66450b9c4283c1b8ce.poster.avif?t=1759448277\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/07fc2beaa94f3e66450b9c4283c1b8ce.webm?t=1759448277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/07fc2beaa94f3e66450b9c4283c1b8ce.mp4?t=1759448277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>crime syndicate</strong> has infiltrated the city. With a bit of coin, they\u2019ll <i>\u201credecorate\u201d</i> your rivals' shops, steal their goods, or drain their pockets. Fair, right?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/89e6348470456d64bdb0d550529b798b.poster.avif?t=1759448277\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/89e6348470456d64bdb0d550529b798b.webm?t=1759448277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/89e6348470456d64bdb0d550529b798b.mp4?t=1759448277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheeky little <strong>fountain fairy</strong> now grants you 3 chances per day \u2014 buff your shop, debuff your rivals, run like Sonic, or slow others like turtles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>End-of-Day &amp; Witch Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each day, players:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Review profits and reputation gains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 3 mysterious Witch Cards: blessings or curses<br>(e.g., price hikes, shelf buffs, stealing rival fame)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card can turn the tides\u2014<strong>a well-timed curse could ruin a rival\u2019s empire</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/05ec6e46b9984e4ab818b1f4a9aadebe.poster.avif?t=1759448277\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/05ec6e46b9984e4ab818b1f4a9aadebe.webm?t=1759448277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/05ec6e46b9984e4ab818b1f4a9aadebe.mp4?t=1759448277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/a14b4104a8feecaac3902377242b0197.poster.avif?t=1759448277\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/a14b4104a8feecaac3902377242b0197.webm?t=1759448277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/extras/a14b4104a8feecaac3902377242b0197.mp4?t=1759448277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart, fast-paced economic decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real player interactions: price wars, sabotage, psychological mind games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily randomness keeps each session fresh</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bizarre goblin world filled with charm and chaos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade smart. Hex hard. Rule the goblin market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is not capitalism. This is survival.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Busy Merchant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420920/6bcbe7bc841f3448a3d63a579a4b7aa34e609b06.jpg"},{"name":"Sales Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420920/92c1ab5d338812b1b20365fb13654af44a0757fb.jpg"},{"name":"Master Seller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati